        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Dario, father of a disabled child, begins to receive attention from his brother's teenage son, discovering that he prefers him to his own. In the growing complicity with his nephew he finds the son he would have liked to have, he takes on the role of the father he could have been. An illusory and dangerous role-playing game that will put the entire family at risk.",
          "runtime": 110,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Children of the Monkey"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Dario, ojciec niepełnosprawnego dziecka, zaczyna zwracać na siebie uwagę nastoletniego syna swojego brata, odkrywając, że woli go od swojego. W rozwijającej się więzi z siostrzeńcem odkrywa syna, którego pragnął mieć, i przyjmuje rolę ojca, którym sam mógłby być. To iluzoryczna i niebezpieczna gra fabularna, która narazi całą rodzinę na niebezpieczeństwo.",
          "runtime": 110,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "I figli della scimmia"
